// {{gfwpro_token}}

### send an invitation to create a connection between two organizations
POST https://localhost:8443/b2b/invitation
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

{
  "email": "icollins@wri.org",
  "organization": 3
}

### resend an invitation to create a connection between two organizations
POST https://localhost:8443/b2b/invitation/75
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### get the invitations sent by the actual user
GET https://localhost:8443/b2b/invitation/me
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}


